{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/848301-demon-past","id":848301,"title":"Demon Past","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-16T11:46:54-07:00","id":848301,"title":"Demon Past","content":"Going to be playing a WoD game eventually where my demon is going to remember who he was (he currently thinks he's a regular human right now due to amnesia). I was writing up the backstory, I left it short without going into too many details, but wanted to check if what I have fits in the same vein as the setting. I've been slowly going through DtD again, but (despite the story bits, I have trouble sitting down to read a textbook - no matter how fun).<br /> <br /> My Demon (Abiel/Mr. Goodchild) watched over Sodom and Gomorrah until Swords were sent to destroy it, protected Moses and the Jewish people during the flight from Egypt, protected Christians in Rome until it was time for them to be thrown to the beasts, protected English nobility during the Hundred Years War in France, spared some soldiers from mustard gas during WW1, then finally Fell when he was protecting a single human in a time and place of low turmoil (no need for him to deflect bullets and etc. - no war to distract him).<br /> <br /> So, my question more relates to the Biblical bits - from Sodom and Gomorrah to Rome with some of the HYW. Is this alright for a Demon's backstory while he was an Angel? Or am I mixing infernal beings here?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!<br /> <br /> And ('stolen' from the inspirational image gallery) - Abiel pre-Fall and post-Fall, there are going to be more splashes for his demonic form (have ideas, and might post them if people wouldn't mind giving their thoughts on that, too!):<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://pre05.deviantart.net/b034/th/pre/i/2015/299/f/7/halo_sep_series___wrath_by_tsaber-d8v7yie.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://pre05.deviantart.net/b034/th/...er-d8v7yie.jpg</a> - Angel <a href=\"http://img12.deviantart.net/ec20/i/2014/325/9/5/hades__ruler_of_the_planet_of_darkness_regular_by_concept_art_house-d65a8e3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://img12.deviantart.net/ec20/i/2...se-d65a8e3.jpg</a> - Demon<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11491-thehallow1","name":"thehallow1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T11:57:23-07:00","id":848307,"title":"","content":"Nothing looks out of place. Due to unkeep requirements, Abiel was probably in storage for large stretches of that time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T12:03:32-07:00","id":848315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/848301-demon-past?p=848307#post848307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nothing looks out of place. Due to unkeep requirements, Abiel was probably in storage for large stretches of that time.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah - I went with the idea that he was able to just be placed in stasis for long stretches rather than have to have a system wipe, as he was always sent into tumultuous missions that never really gave him the chance to experience anything other than his mission. <br /> <br /> Thanks for the response!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11491-thehallow1","name":"thehallow1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T12:09:49-07:00","id":848319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thehallow1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/848301-demon-past?p=848315#post848315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah - I went with the idea that he was able to just be placed in stasis for long stretches rather than have to have a system wipe, as he was always sent into tumultuous missions that never really gave him the chance to experience anything other than his mission.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the response!</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. Welcome to the forum. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So, the character is being run as the Cover, first, then refocusing the narrative/viewpoint to the Demon behind that Cover? Do they remember all this normally, or must they unlock these memories via the plot or their Cypher?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-16T12:32:13-07:00","id":848341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/848301-demon-past?p=848319#post848319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sure. Welcome to the forum. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> So, the character is being run as the Cover, first, then refocusing the narrative/viewpoint to the Demon behind that Cover? Do they remember all this normally, or must they unlock these memories via the plot or their Cypher?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes - he currently is convinced that he's only been alive for 28 years and has been human for all of that time. Was playing it up as part of the backlash from Falling - he saved the woman from dying at her agreed upon time and in response for this decision that part of his life (the two being engaged) blew up with her leaving him and then him forgetting his true past, the Cover taking over for it in a sort of self-defense response.<br /> <br /> Once he remembers, and not 100% sure yet on how he'll remember all these things - I think the DMs are going to be revealing it once each character becomes their supernatural self (we tend to take a small step back from actual systems, so as it stands I'm currently the only demon player - we have potentially two Beasts, a werewolf, a mage, and a human), his narrative will definitely focus on him coming to terms with what he used to be and what he is now. Definitely going to leave strings of his humanity (his Fall took place two years ago, so he's had two years to actually live his Cover fully) still tied into him and struggle with some of the necessities of being a demon.<br /> <br /> Mostly, that's going to be true for whenever he needs to make a Pact with someone - he feels horrible for taking a part of their life, but knows he has to do it so he can keep moving. If the DMs leave it up to me, I'll have him remember everything as soon as he snaps out of it and then have him stumble along trying to learn life as a demon without any other demons (that I know of) to really help him.<br /> <br /> And glad to be here - soon as I saw DtD two years ago (as a small quick teaser) I fell in love with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11491-thehallow1","name":"thehallow1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}